{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-14_end",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-14",
  "title": "搶佔舷側區域",
  "storyCode": "14-16",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-14_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "085994bd8ec35d86bfbb8da260e5c6fad0291d84dac02f144e75ad5bb40e4238",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你說你們不會抵抗——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們想用死來解脫——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我不信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "將死的刺客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她將匕首遞進了刺客的胸膛，特意避開致命的要害。\n她想聽到躲藏在面罩下的懦夫的哀嚎。\n她緩緩轉動著匕首。哪怕只是一聲怯懦的氣音……\n她渴望聽到。\n但什麼也沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "將死的刺客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你不會現在就死。這麼簡單就死……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們……帶走了殿下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "死，太輕易了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你說你們接下任務時已經不準備活著——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我不信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你也想活對不對？你不想逃嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她想要他們逃，她渴望他們逃。\n這樣她才能追逐，才能獵殺，才能讓他們在無盡的絕望裡死去。\n她要飲用他們的絕望。\n可這樣也不夠。遠遠不夠。到底怎麼樣才夠呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "來，拿著這枚手榴彈。它馬上就會爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我就蹲在這裡，向我證明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你也可以扔掉它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "扔掉它，你會活著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我不殺你，我會放你走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "將死的刺客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "扔啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "將死的刺客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "將死的刺客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這東西爆炸應該會讓我什麼都不留下吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "將死的刺客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "將死的刺客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你該站遠點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她不相信。她想要找到眼前之人假裝的痕跡。\n只要他猶豫。只要他想要活下去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "白光從她的面前綻放，爆炸的原點在那隻緊緊攥著手榴彈的手裡。\n火光從她的臉龐掠過，但她卻感受不到絲毫的滿足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "遠遠不夠……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "夠了，W！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "他都化成灰了！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "不，還不夠。\n遠遠不夠。\n我還準備了更多東西——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "W！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "……W。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她看到了黑色的潮水在爆炸的餘燼中翻湧，退去。\n那個人呢？已經完全找不到痕跡了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……我是不是一口氣把儲備用得太多了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "管它呢，存著不用才是浪費。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你沒事了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我……沒事。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你剛才……怎麼了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "沒怎麼啊，不是在救你嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（低沉的嘶鳴）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "小怪物，你記得這些人吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "這些在過去就該全死掉的幽靈……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（憤怒的高吼）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……過去就該死掉的人？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你認識這些……幽靈？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你不認識嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我……應該認識嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你現在冷靜得……有點讓我害怕。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "呵。你最好不認識。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我不知道這是死魂靈的什麼把戲。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "還是在殿下所在的這艘船上——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但他死定了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "恐怕沒有這麼簡單……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我預感，之後還會出現更多……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那我求之不得。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我現在對這次行動，越來越有興趣了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "走吧。是這個方向嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "對，這邊。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不，那邊。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你走前面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "怕什麼，這個小怪物會陪著你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "待在我的視野內，我才能隨時反應。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "……好吧。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "和我合作也沒有多麼困難，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "廊道上充斥著死亡的味道。死寂，讓人噁心。\n不用別人的幫助，她也能確定，他們離死魂靈的核心越來越近。\n殿下怎麼會願意待在這種地方？\n殿下也會在那裡嗎？\n殿下，還記得我嗎？\n她有很多的問題，但是想得越多，她反而越難以興奮。\n不能讓殿下看到她這樣低沉的樣子……\n殿下總是會笑著對她說，她多笑笑就好看多了。她記得很清楚——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我正想你們呢，混蛋們。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "飛空艇的“幽靈”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "到此為止。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "飛空艇的“幽靈”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "到此為止……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "飛空艇的“幽靈”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "前面不能通過。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "{@nickname}，別停。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "走廊的盡頭一定就是我們要找的地方。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你只需要抓緊小怪物，其他什麼都不用管。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我保證，他們在碰到你之前就會全都變成灰燼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "飛空艇的“幽靈”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你一個人總有顧不上的時候。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "——？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（憤怒的嘶吼）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Mon3tr，我沒事！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "W，再幫我拖延一些時間，我有辦法能解決！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我不是小兔子！不用你告訴我怎麼做！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你要做什麼就乾脆點，別廢話。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……我相信你。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "好，我繼續往前走。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "飛空艇的“幽靈”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你們去處理博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "喂，你們不會真以為我會就這麼扔著那個人不管吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "飛空艇的“幽靈”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "和死魂靈那個發瘋的老東西待久了讓你們腦子也不會用了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我可是提前給他留了一堆禮物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "眼睛閉緊了，{@nickname}——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "“砰”！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "好痛……我就知道你沒這麼老實。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "果然你在我身上還留了“保險”……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "還輪不到你誇我。本來想等和老女人會合時給她點驚喜，現在全浪費了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "飛空艇的“幽靈”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "注意。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "再多賞你們些好東西！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "邊邊角角全給你們照亮了，你們會不會死得快點——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "嘁，不行嗎？那只好用老方法，都再砍一次了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（興奮地附和）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你只要顧好那個人的小命就好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（不滿地低吼）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "幽靈從走廊盡頭的黑暗中源源不斷地湧出來，彷彿永遠也殺不完。\n一批接一批，無懼死亡。\n就像當年一樣——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "到底是誰在幫你們？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "沉默的刺客",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她沒有得到任何回應。\n這條好像沒有盡頭的走廊明明躺滿了兇手的屍體，但她為何還是拼湊不出關於這場背叛的完整真相？\n但她確定，真相就藏在這裡。\n藏在巴別塔，藏在PRTS系統記錄的每項不起眼的任務裡。\n甚至就藏在……這條走廊的盡頭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "就在這裡……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "——？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "就在這裡……在這些屍體的下面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你是回來增援的嗎……去救殿下……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你為什麼在這……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我想保護殿下，但不知道被誰打暈了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我們是不是救下殿下了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你看到那些刺客了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "本艦的防禦系統突然失效，接著很多人突然湧了進來……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我們都想保護殿下，和我一起的兄弟們——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "這些是你的兄弟？他們死了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但你活下來了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "殿下死了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "呵，保護殿下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "拿著這顆手榴彈，繼續保護殿下吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她忍住了衝動……如果自己當時留在這裡有多好。\n如果她留下來了……結果會不一樣嗎？\n她跨過屍體，沿著走廊繼續走下去。\n然而，背後那聲爆炸的轟鳴卻遲遲沒有響起。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "廢物。懦夫。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "當她渾身是血地走到議長室門口時，刺客的屍體堆滿了入口，她不想再往前走了。\n沒有殺掉叛徒，她怎麼有資格悼念殿下？\n主導這一切的人是誰，她心中早以推算出自己的答案。\n是那個人帶著所有的刺客，站到這裡，將死亡引向殿下。\n殺掉所有參與這場惡行的人後，她將去向那個人討一個答案。\n那會是她最後一個目標……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "W，該走了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "門開了，現在進艙室！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……你——"
