        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "自走廊盡頭的陰影中，走出了阿米婭從未想過會在此遇到的人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "阿米婭一直未曾忘記多年前的那場噩夢。\n她記得特蕾西婭，記得那柄插入自己胸膛的黑色長劍……\n記得那些穿著黑色長袍的兇手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "不可能……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你們……應該都死了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "阿斯卡綸小姐明明確認過……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "飛空艇的“幽靈”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……“魔王”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "飛空艇的“幽靈”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你晚了一步，她知道你會來此。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "特蕾西婭小姐……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "飛空艇的“幽靈”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "阿米婭，你所尋找的人，他們必死無疑。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "——？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "讓開。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你們……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "飛空艇的“幽靈”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "省下你讀取情緒的功夫吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "飛空艇的“幽靈”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "止步於此……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "飛空艇的“幽靈”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "或是跨過我們的屍體。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我看到了你們腦海中破碎的畫面——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "怎麼會……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你們來自巴別塔？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
